{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act11mini_level_act11mini_st02",
  "groupId": "act11mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "后会有期",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11mini/level_act11mini_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0778778150174b460629bae14503474b0c92c22b94aff34d8759402c7821ffac",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "大清早的，还有点凉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "尚蜀这天气，现在嫌凉了，到晌午又热得很，难伺候啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "寒暑需有个度，想来尚蜀百姓早已适应。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "说得是。不过瞧着最近雨水多了，怕是天气要变。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "希望不是什么大寒大暑，给人点时间适应适应。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "季候到了，总有些变节。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "船家，可否载我一程。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "您说，去哪儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "渡江。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "没问题。您看您这江，是怎么渡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "走哪条道，赶时间不赶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "有什么不同？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "要是行得急，时间紧，我便行快船，费不了多少工夫就能到对岸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "若我不急又如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "那就得在渡口先整治些酒菜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "酒在船上温着，船就从上游这渡口，贴着边漂下去。能看到城市，也能瞧见正在种的田，风景好着呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "听着不差。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "那就这么定，我先把酒温上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "......你倒很会做生意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "做这行的，总归得有些眼力见儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "您这样的老丈，没几个不爱多看看这尚蜀城的。就算不看城，也爱看人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "说的不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "人，确实当看，若不看人，就是白走一遭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "梁洵应当与你说过，他今晚便该随我回京。出尚蜀这趟路，便由你指引。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......确实说过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "您别怪罪，梁大人这回走得急，我们这些人难免多担忧些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "我们这知府大人......说是了不得的父母官，可到底还年轻着呢，有时候看着就像家里的子侄，让人担心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "梁洵他有这般才能，也有志气。顶得住，便是功成名就。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "要是顶不住呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "——唉，算了，不该问。您要看看这尚蜀，只管跟我来便是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "就是可惜，鲤小子前头还在找人，我看今天他要见梁大人，是难了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "天还有些凉，好在茶是热的，倒也不冷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "梁大人公务繁忙，今天怎么来得这么早？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "说好陪你看戏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "多披些衣物，小心风寒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "什么时候说好了？之前只说，得空了就一起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "今日就得空。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "骗人。太傅交代得那么紧急，工作上的交接就有大堆麻烦......梁大人莫非是昨夜没睡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "咳，有稍微合眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "宁小姐今天也醒得早。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "我猜不听人劝的梁大人今天一早会来，一直在等着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "这，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "茶杯空了，杯子递给我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......多谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "一杯茶而已，你我之间还用说谢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "能在这山上坐坐，喝茶醒醒神，也不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "这儿的茶点味道也挺好......油酥，芝麻糕，还有——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "糖果子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "上回宁小姐夸奖过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "啊，您就记着了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "嗯。宁小姐喜欢，就多留意了些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "尚蜀什么都好，就是口味上有点重，好在糕点大多还是香软甜口的，合我的口味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "唉，梁大人府里煮的锅子最初也辣得很，之后倒好了不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "最初动不了一筷子就要找水，太狼狈了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "府里解辣的汤时刻备着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "宁小姐的家乡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "南边水乡，不大吃辣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "难为你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "这有什么，总归要适应的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "话虽如此，这不是轻易能做到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "有心想要适应，就不难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "总归要适应的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "梁大人之前提过，您是尚蜀本地人吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "梁某人早年离家，近些年才回到故乡。宁小姐知道的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "听你提起过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "这么说来，你的那位龙门朋友，就是在离家期间遇上的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "那时少不知事，离家闯荡，交了不少朋友，以为少年意气无坚不摧，无所不可为......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "做了不少贻笑大方的蠢事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "交朋友可不算蠢事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "梁大人，你交的是位好朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......是梁某幸运。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "要不是这次事出紧急，确实该好好请你那位朋友在尚蜀游览一番，尽一尽地主之谊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "还能多听两句梁大人的过往趣事，不知道同现在差别大不大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "我从未变过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "或许还是有些变化。不过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "梁某人要做的事，为一方百姓......从未变过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "昨夜太傅提出随他上京......我原本，不想应下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "你怪我替你答应了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "不。不会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "那时犹豫已经是不应该，我该谢谢宁小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "你不怪罪我就好了。你放心不下尚蜀，我能理解，其他人也能，但太傅开口是不一样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "太傅身边不留庸才。他老人家给出的，只会是最险、最难搏的机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "我想如果我没看错梁洵这个人，那你要是一时犹豫拒绝了，之后一定是会后悔的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......我明白。让宁小姐担心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......呵呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "宁小姐......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "啊，没事，没什么。我只是忽然想到......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "你那时要是当真毫不犹豫地同意要走，恐怕，我也是要有些生气的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......咳。宁小姐说笑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "我可不是说笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "咳咳咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "这才多久，日头就起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "梁大人，这戏好看吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "尚可。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "那要不要早些下山？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "不用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......再看一会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "宁小姐，再看一会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "好了好了，爹！别看了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "有什么啊，这有什么可看的，不就一张行程单嘛，我和其他人都商量好了，等东西收拾好了就出发！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我还有一屋子的东西没收拾呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "急什么，我再看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你们一群年轻人，决定做得那么急，容易出事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "年轻人怎么了？谁还不是从年轻时过来的，爹你年轻时不也天南地北地走镖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "能一样吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "没人带着，你们晓得道上哪条路走得，哪条路走不得？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "这时节出这么趟远门，你可知该带什么，不该带什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "爹！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "时代不同了爹，可别翻您那老黄历了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "遥夜！听话，爹能给你说的不多了，这次......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你定了要去玉门城，就去吧。我也拦不住你们，不走我们给铺的这条路，没准也是好事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "爹啊，假如说啊，我就打个比方......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "假如我们这客栈不开了，您还有几个叔伯，有没有考虑过和我们一起去玉门城？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......遥夜啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "哎爹我就随口说说，我晓得肯定不成的！您就随便听听......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "遥夜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......哎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "这客栈本来就是为你留的，你要是不接手，趁早歇业关门也好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你说要自立门户，我不拦着，我信你是有考虑的，但我还是得给你说两句，你也别嫌爹啰嗦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "爹......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你给年轻人们牵了头，他们都信你，跟着你，你说时代变了......没错，时代是变了，但这事放在什么时候都变不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你既然站出来，一呼百应，那往后遇上再难的事，你也不能退，再苦，再累，你得担着，听见没有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我......知道的，爹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......唉。行了，这单子你拿去，有些不那么好走的路，我给你避开些，能走大道便走大道，那些我们蹚过的泥巴路，你们可别再踩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "您放心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "放心，难啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "我现在就有桩心事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "您说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "遥夜，你年纪也不小了，这次去玉门城，能不能正经带个小伙子回来看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "停，停！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "爹！瞎操什么心呢！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "怎么是瞎操心了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "这就是瞎操心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "哎呀，不同爹你说了，我还要去一趟梁大人府里......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你找梁大人作甚？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "不是我要找，是那个姓鲤的要找！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "他都找不着，可见梁大人应当不在府里，你去又有什么用？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......有道理。好啊，这姓鲤的又用这招糊弄我！我现在就去找他算账！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "姑娘家家的，什么时候才能稳重些哦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "别人的家事，不要东张西望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......不用操心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "麟青砚，你现在这是什么意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "吃饭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "你知道我不是问这个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "你一早就等在这里，阻拦我去见那三位，总得给我一个理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "我说过，我会同你一起去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "麟青砚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "大呼小叫，像什么样子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "我并非代表大理寺走这一趟，不论官职，你该叫我什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "规矩你是忘了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......小姨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "何必总搬出这一套来压我？又不是什么正经的亲戚，你也不过是仗着麟家和我爹相交，长我一个辈分......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "天师府这次要你走这一趟，到底为了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "自然是为百姓苍生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "好一个为百姓苍生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "既然如此，真就要放任......真就这么继续下去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "太傅已经做下判断，我等遵令即可。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "倒是你，左乐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "你入司岁台时日尚浅，这次尚蜀背后所藏之事不简单，现在看来，许多内幕你并不知情......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "当差却一知半解，荒唐！谁叫你来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......无人指派，是我主动请缨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "怎么，你不相信？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "我信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "我信你主动请缨，却也信有人背后作怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......我倒是头一次听说，大理寺铁面无私忠直坦白的麟青砚，也学会揣测这些官场阴私了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "传闻里你不是最厌烦理会这类蝇营狗苟，要是有人与你聒噪，就要电他个顶盖发麻？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "如今这样，可不是你的风格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "我的行事风格，不必你提点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "我被托付关照你，事关你，自然应当谨慎些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "你弹舌？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "没有的事，小姨听错了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "待此间事了，你也该同我回一趟京城。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "可......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊蛰",
      "text": "这是左将军的意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "知道了。我随你回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "礼部左侍郎......其实是个不太参与政务的职位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "梁大人有没有听说过，我如今这官职是怎么来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "愿闻其详。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "梁大人靠自己出人头地，这是我比不上的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "宁家......算是个大姓。祖上蒙荫，后人也算上进，一辈辈积累些门路财产，就这么传下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "我祖父官至一品，勤勤恳恳几十年，就是我不说名字，梁大人应该也认得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "也就是对着梁大人，我才肯说，不然这话显得像是我要炫耀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "不会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "宁小姐......很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "我知道你不会这么想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "之前也和梁大人说过，我在家中同辈的兄弟姐妹里行七。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "我父亲那一辈人志不在此，小辈们也是，我最大的堂兄大我十来岁，早已成家立业。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "祖父准备从官场上退下时，正巧我年少气盛，被卷进一个走私贪污的案子，侥幸抓了一串贼人，转天公文就被送到祖父案头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "宁小姐才干过人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "场面话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "不敢。是真心话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "那我信你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "祖父那时候单独将我喊去书房，我们没聊什么特别的，他老人家就问了我一个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "他问：“辞秋，你这一身才学本领，可愿为国、为民、为天下？”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "我就答说......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......肝脑涂地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "在所不辞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "宁小姐好气魄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "好啦，故事就讲到这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "梁大人，茶凉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "还有些温度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "可我看梁大人你的手已凉了。要是你乐意我将这披风还你一半，我们倒也不是不能再沏上一壶热茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......身体要紧，披好，别摘了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "我没事，不信你试试......是不是比你梁洵暖和？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "梁某人手冷，别冻着宁小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "哎呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "今天之后，不知要什么时候才有机会再见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "宁小姐要多保重身体，不要贪凉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......要是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "要是宁小姐往后还要赏花，不嫌路途遥远，便不必自己动手，托人带一封信，交给我来种就是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "宁小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "哎，啊，嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "嗯......你既然都这样说了，那我就也直说了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "梁大人，你兜里那扎了缎带的首饰盒子，还要揣多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......咳，这是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "怎么，梁大人，难不成那还能是你准备要送给旁人的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "顶唔顺啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......不该带你来找人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "不该。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "你不露面？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "现在露面，不合适吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "他们这你来我往，简直比台上的戏还精彩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "谁想到这姓梁的......唉，算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......不，不行，不能算了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "谁想到这姓梁的，十多年未见，成如今这样！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "十多年未见，不稀奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "难顶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "好在还有茶可喝，有戏可看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "这么一来，梁洵啊，你可是又欠我一笔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "想找老朋友喝最后一杯酒，到底是难咯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
